# Dependencies + build output — never commit these into the per-project workspace
# git. The agent's autoCommit does `git add -A`; without this, every build commits
# node_modules + dist (observed ~64 MB), which bloats git AND dominates the
# reviewer's `git diff <firstCommit> HEAD` so the real app code gets truncated out
# of the (size-capped) review diff — the reviewer then false-criticals "no app code
# generated". node_modules is reinstalled at container start; dist is recompiled.
node_modules/
dist/
*.log

# Local env (DATABASE_URL + JWT/secret values) — regenerated at container start from
# the container's env vars; keep secrets out of git.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
